      "image": "assets/images/152931/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar, water, and cinnamon in a saucepan over medium heat; bring to a boil. Add almonds; cook and stir mixture until liquid evaporates and leaves a syrupy coating on almonds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lIfPpfMJk1khfeS46MiN42PzjHU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-152931-candied-almonds-DDMFS-step-04-db0e258e591b47c7a18acf0b849da054.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/152931/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour almonds onto the prepared baking sheet; use two forks to separate clumps and spread into an even layer.",
